2085 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1427 0 R
/E (The Objective section includes what you observe as the clinician. The core of the Objective section is the Mental Status Exam \(MSE\). In this chapter, you will learn the parts of the MSE, how to describe findings in a clear and professional way, and how to avoid judgmental language. You will also see model wording you can use in your own notes.)
